# Regular expressions for URLs ./check-links-external.sh should not check.
# lychee reads this file automatically when run from the repository root.

# Our own site: those links are checked properly, against the local build,
# by ./check-links-internal.sh. Checking them here would only test whatever
# is currently deployed.
^https?://blog\.poleprediction\.com

# Hosts that block link checkers rather than answering honestly. Add to this
# list only after confirming by hand that the link is actually fine.
